[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-ncdmb-oil-and-gas-training-program-for-field-readiness-2026-paid-opportunity--239":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},239,"ncdmb-oil-and-gas-training-program-for-field-readiness-2026-paid-opportunity--239","Ncdmb Oil And Gas Training Program For Field Readiness 2026 (paid Opportunity)","\u003Cp>The Federal Government, through the Nigerian Content Development and Management Board, (NCDMB) has launched the NCDMB Oil and Gas Field Readiness Training Program in order to equip young Nigerians with skills for top opportunities in the oil and gas industry.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The oil and gas training seekd to train over 10,000 young graduates and technicians in the top 10 high-demand skills across the sector.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Participants get free medical checks, ₦150,000 monthly stipends, personal protective equipment, and insurance coverage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>NCDMB Oil and Gas Training Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Federal Government\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Sponsorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Free Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>₦150,000 Monthly Stipend\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Certification\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment Opportunity\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career Development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 26, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>About the NCDMB Oil and Field Readiness Training Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Nigerian Content Development and Monitoring Board (NCDMB) has launched a large-scale human capital development initiative to train over 10,000 young Nigerians in high-demand skills for the oil and gas industry.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The program, themed the Oil and Gas Field Readiness Training Program, is designed to prepare graduates and technicians for opportunities in new projects driven by the recent resurgence of major investments in Nigeria’s energy sector.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Additionally, the NCDMB Oil and Gas Training will be delivered in partner ship with at least three service companies in each skill area to deliver hands-on experience and ensure participants are ready for employment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>NCDMB Oil and Gas Training Benefits 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The NCDMB Oil and Gas Training offers the following benefits;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The programme will run for two to three years, combining classroom learning, laboratory work, certification, and at least six months of on-the-job training in collaboration with leading service companies.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on experience with companies like Shell, SNEPCo, TotalEnergies, and Seplat to ensure participants are ready for employment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Participants will also receive medical checks, monthly stipends, personal protective equipment, and insurance coverage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How much is the NCDMB Training Allowance\u002FStipend?\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Participants are offered a monthly stipend of between ₦125,000 and ₦200,000. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for NCDMB Oil and Gas Field Readiness Training Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the NCDMB Oil and Gas Field Readiness Training Program, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click the green button below to visit the \u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002Fwww.nogicjqs.gov.ng\">NOGIC JQS portal\u003C\u002Fa>. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Create an account and update your academic records before registering for the program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Once your profile is completely updated, you can proceed to register for the training program. Individuals with incomplete profiles are required to complete their details before applying.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You are allowed to select up to three preferred skill areas under the program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Begin your application by clicking on the button below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 26th, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002Fwww.nogicjqs.gov.ng?utm_source=ScholarsWorld\">\u003Cbr \u002F>\u003Cstrong> Click Here To Apply: \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002Fwww.nogicjqs.gov.ng\u002F?utm_source=ScholarsWorld\">\u003Cstrong>http:\u002F\u002Fwww.nogicjqs.gov.ng\u002F?utm_source=ScholarsWorld\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-16 12:57:29",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fncdmb-oil-and-gas-training-program-for-field-readiness-2026-paid-opportunity\u002F6a085ba9173e00.09256569_screenshot 202